+-------------------------------------------------------------------------
+    Instanced rendering tests
+
+Tests:
+ + dEQP-GLES3.functional.instanced.*
+
+Includes:
+ + Draw using:
+   - glDrawArraysInstanced()
+   - glDrawElementsInstanced()
+ + Do instancing using:
+   - gl_InstanceID vertex shader input
+   - glVertexAttribDivisor()
+   - Mixture of the above
+ + Instance counts 1, 2, 4, 20
